# Documentation

- Always include context-based docstrings at file tops noting purpose and environment assumptions.
- Always update the root-level README whenever logic changes that affect usage, behavior, or CLI expectations.
- When sub-READMEs exist, ensure they remain consistent with the root README.
- Document external system configuration and env vars.
- Avoid interactive input prompts — prefer CLI args or environment config.
